<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling falls on dollar and pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling falls on dollar and pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling fell for a third consecutive day against the dollar on Wednesday, exchanging at a commercial mean rate of 596.7720 to the dollar compared to Tuesday's mean of 596.4453, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The shilling traded at 1,011.9776 to the pound compared with Tuesday's mean rate of 1,010.3681.</p>
